WEBVTT

00:12.019 --> 00:13.061
CHEMISTRY

00:13.228 --> 00:15.731
[Toshiro] <i>In order to kill Ivy,</i>
<i>I'll need a weapon.</i>

00:16.732 --> 00:18.734
<i>A powerful combustion reaction occurs</i>

00:18.817 --> 00:21.445
<i>when sulfuric acid, sugar,</i>
<i>and potassium chlorate are combined.</i>

00:21.528 --> 00:22.362
CHEMISTRY: REVISED EDITION
ENGLISH - BASIC BIOLOGY

00:23.530 --> 00:26.908
I'm glad I didn't throw away
my textbooks from junior high.

00:26.992 --> 00:28.118
- [doorbell ringing]
- [gasps]

00:28.744 --> 00:29.619
KAORI & TOSHIRO KAMIYA

00:29.703 --> 00:30.620
Yeah?

00:31.079 --> 00:32.497
Hey, you're Toshiro, right?

00:32.581 --> 00:34.041
We'll be staying here for a bit.

00:34.124 --> 00:35.584
Huh? Uh, wait!

00:35.667 --> 00:36.918
Who are you guys?

00:37.002 --> 00:38.670
Hey, Toshiro.

00:38.754 --> 00:41.173
Two mercenaries
are heading over to your place.

00:41.256 --> 00:42.466
They're watching Hikasa.

00:42.549 --> 00:44.009
<i>Let them stay with you, 'kay?</i>

00:44.092 --> 00:44.926
[Toshiro] Huh?

00:45.010 --> 00:45.969
My name's Myan.

00:46.053 --> 00:47.429
That guy there is Graham.

00:47.512 --> 00:48.680
I'm gonna use your shower.

00:49.097 --> 00:50.515
<i>Thanks for helping. Bye.</i>

00:53.268 --> 00:54.311
"Thanks" my ass…

00:56.605 --> 00:58.607
[opening theme song playing]

01:09.785 --> 01:14.122
FOOL NIGHT

02:26.611 --> 02:28.530
[protestors booing]
Down with Transfloration!

02:28.613 --> 02:29.447
Shit.

02:29.990 --> 02:31.199
[grunting]

02:31.283 --> 02:32.826
[protestors continue shouting]

02:34.077 --> 02:34.995
[grunting]

02:35.078 --> 02:36.830
We're currently standing
in front of the Transfloration Board.

02:36.913 --> 02:39.040
- [man 1] See what that bastard just did?
- Hey, over there!

02:39.624 --> 02:40.584
[man 2] Take 'em down!

02:40.667 --> 02:41.793
Something's happening here!

02:41.877 --> 02:43.003
[man 3] That's enough!

02:43.086 --> 02:44.129
[man 4] Hey!

02:44.212 --> 02:46.965
<i>A fight between</i>
<i>the protesters and police broke…</i>

02:47.048 --> 02:48.216
[inaudible]

02:51.970 --> 02:54.556
[Jin] Are these guys the mercenaries
that Kunibe lent you?

02:54.639 --> 02:55.473
[Yomiko] Yeah.

02:55.557 --> 02:56.725
Takami.

02:56.808 --> 02:58.059
I'm Asada.

02:58.143 --> 02:59.227
Yorutake.

02:59.311 --> 03:00.604
The reason you're all here

03:00.687 --> 03:03.773
is to talk about a certain document
that we acquired.

03:04.232 --> 03:05.150
[Akira] A document?

03:05.233 --> 03:07.527
A secret document about Dr. Kudai.

03:07.611 --> 03:08.445
[Akira] What?

03:08.528 --> 03:10.363
I borrowed it from the Archives.

03:10.447 --> 03:14.242
It's the organization that stores records,
important ones, about Transfloration.

03:14.326 --> 03:17.495
It's a plan to create a Spiriflor
capable of moving.

03:17.579 --> 03:20.457
Transflora Medical and Dr. Kudai
researched it together.

03:21.207 --> 03:23.293
This document is the prototype for Ivy.

03:23.376 --> 03:27.797
Forty years ago, before Dr. Kudai joined
the Anti-Transfloration Movement,

03:27.881 --> 03:31.384
he was working with Transflora Medical,
researching how to develop Ivy.

03:34.554 --> 03:38.141
At least that's what this
little fake document I made says.

03:39.142 --> 03:40.352
Don't scare me like that!

03:40.727 --> 03:41.603
It's convincing.

03:41.686 --> 03:43.438
Even the seal on it looks real.

03:44.189 --> 03:47.817
So basically this is bait to lure
the Anti-Transfloration Movement.

03:48.360 --> 03:49.444
That's exactly right.

03:49.527 --> 03:53.406
I believe that this document
is going to lead us straight to Dr. Kudai.

03:54.783 --> 03:56.493
Tell us the rest of the plan.

03:56.576 --> 04:00.121
[Yomiko] Okay. So,
our main goal here is to find Dr. Kudai,

04:00.205 --> 04:02.040
the man who created Ivy.

04:02.123 --> 04:06.795
The truth is, the fastest way to do that
would be for Hikasa to meet with him.

04:06.878 --> 04:09.130
But Hikasa realized he was being watched,

04:09.214 --> 04:11.508
and since then,
he and the Anti-Transfloration Movement

04:11.591 --> 04:12.676
haven't made a move.

04:12.759 --> 04:17.180
<i>However, now that we have</i>
<i>all this information about Ivy,</i>

04:17.264 --> 04:19.599
<i>they'll want to find out</i>
<i>who leaked it to us.</i>

04:20.308 --> 04:24.521
This document will point them
in the direction of Transflora Medical.

04:24.604 --> 04:26.231
Then the Anti-Transfloration Movement

04:26.314 --> 04:27.857
will likely use this

04:27.941 --> 04:31.736
to pin all the blame on Transflora Medical
for Ivy's mass murders.

04:32.821 --> 04:35.615
It's not just bait,
it's a full on feast for them.

04:35.699 --> 04:36.533
I think I get it.

04:36.616 --> 04:39.744
If Hikasa wants to expose
Transflora Medical's crimes

04:39.828 --> 04:41.538
described in this document here,

04:41.621 --> 04:43.748
he'll have to bring it up
in court or in the Diet.

04:43.832 --> 04:47.711
When he does, Dr. Kudai would be
the most logical witness to call.

04:48.253 --> 04:49.504
Then, we take him.

04:53.967 --> 04:55.468
Isn't that too risky, though?

04:55.552 --> 04:57.929
What if we aren't able
to capture the doctor?

04:58.596 --> 04:59.848
If that's the case,

04:59.931 --> 05:02.684
we'll need to call Inspectors
from the Archives to court

05:02.767 --> 05:05.145
and have them prove
that the document is a fake.

05:05.228 --> 05:09.733
But if we do that, then Transflora Medical
will punish us for forging the document.

05:09.816 --> 05:12.152
Plus, there's no guarantee
that Hikasa will react to this

05:12.235 --> 05:13.778
the way that we want him to.

05:14.988 --> 05:17.198
I know there are holes in this plan.

05:18.033 --> 05:20.368
But it doesn't matter, we have to act now.

05:21.494 --> 05:24.539
All of the people
who are being kept in the dark,

05:24.622 --> 05:26.624
they're close to reaching
their breaking point.

05:27.459 --> 05:28.877
If they do break…

05:31.212 --> 05:33.548
I think it's going to be
beyond our control.

05:35.884 --> 05:38.219
Well, I say that it's worth a try.

05:44.851 --> 05:45.727
[Yomiko] Hmm.

05:46.853 --> 05:49.689
The hard part here,
is that we have to give them the bait

05:49.773 --> 05:51.900
without them realizing
what it actually is.

05:52.609 --> 05:55.862
It has to look like they stole it from us,
while we were fighting.

05:55.945 --> 05:57.363
They're all amateurs, right?

05:57.447 --> 05:58.490
Should be easy.

05:58.573 --> 06:00.033
We'll make the fight believable.

06:00.116 --> 06:01.993
Underestimate them and you're dead.

06:03.578 --> 06:05.914
I know that one of them is a serious pro.

06:08.875 --> 06:10.502
[somber music playing]

06:24.849 --> 06:25.892
Mm.

06:25.975 --> 06:26.810
Hmm?

06:30.396 --> 06:33.399
[Jin, over phone] <i>Hikasa still hasn't</i>
<i>done anything outta the ordinary.</i>

06:33.483 --> 06:35.735
<i>He hasn't given orders</i>
<i>to his agents either.</i>

06:36.152 --> 06:37.153
[Yomiko] Got it. Thanks.

06:37.612 --> 06:39.239
Just keep an eye on him, please.

06:42.826 --> 06:43.660
TRANSFLORA MEDICAL

06:43.743 --> 06:45.245
[Yomiko] <i>It's already been a week.</i>

06:45.620 --> 06:48.164
<i>Is he really not going</i>
<i>to do anything about this?</i>

06:59.592 --> 07:00.760
[footsteps approaching]

07:11.354 --> 07:12.438
[footsteps getting closer]

07:12.522 --> 07:13.356
[gasps]

07:18.278 --> 07:19.946
- [cell phone ringing]
- [gasps]

07:20.697 --> 07:22.532
<i>- It's Myan.</i>
- Uh, hi, what is it?

07:22.615 --> 07:23.741
I wasn't doing anything.

07:24.242 --> 07:25.160
<i>Huh?</i>

07:25.243 --> 07:26.744
<i>We just need you to get back here.</i>

07:28.496 --> 07:29.998
They started attacking.

07:32.208 --> 07:35.670
[Tachibana over PA] <i>This is Tachibana</i>
<i>from the Transfloration Board Archives.</i>

07:35.753 --> 07:38.590
<i>Transflora Medical Number 4 will be</i>
<i>on lockdown for the next 20 hours.</i>

07:38.673 --> 07:39.507
ARCHIVES PROPERTY

07:40.467 --> 07:43.470
<i>No one will be allowed</i>
<i>to enter or leave the facility.</i>

07:43.553 --> 07:47.765
<i>We ask that you cooperate with this order</i>
<i>from the Transfloration Board Archives.</i>

07:47.849 --> 07:48.933
<i>Thank you, everyone!</i>

07:49.767 --> 07:51.186
- [door clangs shut]
- [Yomiko panting]

07:52.270 --> 07:53.354
[Akira] They're here?

07:53.771 --> 07:54.689
[Yomiko] Yeah.

07:55.231 --> 07:57.984
Hey, all those guys are from the Movement.

07:58.067 --> 08:00.487
There's too many of them.
This wasn't part of the plan.

08:00.570 --> 08:01.821
[panting]

08:01.905 --> 08:03.281
It's not them.

08:03.364 --> 08:07.535
Those are Inspectors
from the Transfloration Board.

08:07.619 --> 08:09.370
They make sure
Transflora Medical employees

08:09.454 --> 08:11.998
don't misuse Transfloration
technology or knowledge.

08:12.499 --> 08:14.209
What the hell are they doing here?

08:14.292 --> 08:16.753
[Yomiko] I'm guessing that
the Movement sent them.

08:17.212 --> 08:19.214
I don't know how they did it, though.

08:20.089 --> 08:21.633
The Movement will blend in with them

08:21.716 --> 08:23.635
and once they're
inside Transflora Medical,

08:23.718 --> 08:25.637
they'll find out it's connected to Ivy.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.222
[Takami] Well, that seems convenient.

08:27.305 --> 08:30.934
They must have come here
to try to look for that fake document.

08:31.017 --> 08:33.019
We need to leave it somewhere
where they'll find it.

08:33.102 --> 08:34.687
[Akira] No, it's the opposite.

08:34.812 --> 08:38.858
If the Inspectors are the ones who
find the fake document that we made,

08:38.942 --> 08:41.027
they'll immediately know
that it's not from the Archives.

08:41.110 --> 08:43.112
If the Movement were to find that out,

08:43.196 --> 08:45.532
it'll prove that
there's no real connection

08:45.615 --> 08:47.951
between Transflora Medical
and Dr. Kudai.

08:49.327 --> 08:50.787
If that were to happen,

08:50.870 --> 08:53.540
then Hikasa would never
fall for our trap again.

08:53.623 --> 08:56.918
We will not get another chance to do this,
to find Dr. Kudai.

09:00.713 --> 09:02.173
The plan's changed for now.

09:02.257 --> 09:04.425
We can't let anyone find the document.

09:05.885 --> 09:07.053
[cell phone ringing]

09:07.136 --> 09:08.012
Yomiko!

09:08.096 --> 09:09.264
[Yomiko over phone] <i>Chief!</i>

09:09.347 --> 09:11.724
The Inspectors from the Archives
are after me now!

09:11.808 --> 09:14.060
They said I'm suspected
of stealing documents.

09:14.143 --> 09:16.312
It's probably because
I went to the Archives-- [groans]

09:16.396 --> 09:17.355
Chief?

09:17.438 --> 09:18.273
HORAI

09:18.356 --> 09:19.315
<i>Chief, are you okay?</i>
<i>What happened?</i>

09:19.399 --> 09:21.568
Okay, okay, I'm not gonna fight back.

09:21.651 --> 09:24.153
I was just scared because
you suddenly started chasing me.

09:24.237 --> 09:26.072
[Tachibana] Chief Jin Hiragishi.

09:27.115 --> 09:29.284
I think that you and I
should have a little chat.

09:30.994 --> 09:32.662
Archivist Tachibana.

09:34.914 --> 09:36.958
[Yomiko]
Chief Hiragishi was just detained.

09:37.041 --> 09:37.959
[all gasp]

09:38.585 --> 09:40.837
I'll be the next one that they come after.

09:40.920 --> 09:43.172
If we're together,
they'll capture us all at once.

09:44.340 --> 09:46.217
I'm gonna go find another place to hide.

09:50.972 --> 09:53.016
This document was specially made.

09:53.683 --> 09:55.560
There aren't any copies of it.

09:55.643 --> 09:58.980
Please guard it for the next 20 hours,
until the inspection's over.

10:05.320 --> 10:06.904
Okay, everyone.

10:06.988 --> 10:08.281
I'm counting on you all.

10:10.199 --> 10:11.451
Toshiro, can you hear me?

10:11.534 --> 10:12.619
Yomiko.

10:12.702 --> 10:14.078
Are you guys okay there?

10:14.162 --> 10:15.204
I heard it's pretty bad.

10:15.288 --> 10:17.749
[Yomiko] Yeah, I don't have time
to give you all the details though.

10:17.832 --> 10:20.460
We're surrounded,
all of Transflora Medical,

10:20.543 --> 10:22.337
by Inspectors from the Archives.

10:22.420 --> 10:25.006
Listen, I need you to bring
a car to Transflora Medical.

10:25.089 --> 10:26.716
- [Yomiko grunts]
- Yomiko?

10:33.806 --> 10:34.766
TOSHIRO

10:34.849 --> 10:36.601
[Toshiro] <i>Yomiko! What happened?</i>

10:36.684 --> 10:37.727
<i>Yomiko!</i>

10:39.646 --> 10:41.481
- [protestors clamoring]
- [patriotic music playing]

10:44.192 --> 10:45.485
Stop it!

10:45.568 --> 10:46.903
Get outta here!

10:48.488 --> 10:49.489
[grunting]

10:55.828 --> 10:56.996
That's enough!

10:58.039 --> 10:59.040
Meg…

11:00.208 --> 11:01.376
[inaudible]

11:06.506 --> 11:07.548
[breathing shakily]

11:09.509 --> 11:10.677
[grunting]

11:10.760 --> 11:13.805
You all work
for Transflora Medical Number 4

11:13.888 --> 11:16.933
in the Administration Department's
"Unsection".

11:17.016 --> 11:19.102
I'm here to inform you,
you're being detained.

11:19.185 --> 11:20.395
What the hell for?

11:20.478 --> 11:22.688
Unsection Chief Jin Hiragishi is suspected

11:22.772 --> 11:25.191
of stealing secret documents
from the Archives.

11:25.274 --> 11:26.275
Damn it, Chief.

11:26.359 --> 11:27.985
- [woman groans]
- I'm not even surprised.

11:28.694 --> 11:31.197
Let us out!
What if we need to pee?

11:32.240 --> 11:33.616
[music continues]

11:38.204 --> 11:39.372
[knock on door]

11:40.164 --> 11:42.083
[man] Excuse us, Deputy Chief Yatsuka.

11:42.166 --> 11:43.584
We're here for an inspection.

11:43.668 --> 11:44.794
Please, let us in.

11:45.586 --> 11:47.380
We're here on orders from the Archives.

11:49.090 --> 11:50.133
[gasps softly]

11:56.848 --> 11:58.391
[footsteps approaching]

12:01.352 --> 12:02.812
Hello, how can I help you two?

12:02.895 --> 12:04.981
Thank you for your cooperation.

12:05.064 --> 12:06.274
And what's your name?

12:06.357 --> 12:08.401
You don't appear to be Chief Yatsuka.

12:08.484 --> 12:09.694
His assistant.

12:09.777 --> 12:10.695
I was just helping him.

12:10.778 --> 12:11.779
[silenced gunshot]

12:11.863 --> 12:13.197
[grunting]

12:23.958 --> 12:27.170
[Takami] They've disguised themselves
as Inspectors and are targeting you.

12:27.253 --> 12:28.796
Let's go somewhere else.

12:29.380 --> 12:30.590
[shuddering]

12:31.883 --> 12:33.092
[ominous music playing]

12:36.679 --> 12:38.556
[Saeko]
I don't blame you for being scared.

12:39.223 --> 12:41.267
But still, you have to try to stay calm.

12:41.976 --> 12:43.603
[footsteps approaching]

12:47.565 --> 12:50.151
[Takami] At least they're not going around
firing their guns at everything.

12:50.860 --> 12:53.154
They used a silencer when they shot Asada.

12:53.237 --> 12:55.781
They're taking advantage
of the Inspectors' presence,

12:55.865 --> 12:57.450
so they have to keep a low profile.

12:57.533 --> 12:59.243
The inspections will be thorough.

12:59.327 --> 13:00.912
They'll start from the lower floors.

13:00.995 --> 13:02.246
We need to go further up.

13:04.790 --> 13:07.251
Akira, how can you do this?

13:08.586 --> 13:10.171
Don't you find it repulsive?

13:11.005 --> 13:12.215
[both grunting]

13:17.637 --> 13:19.305
Tell me how many of you there are!

13:19.388 --> 13:21.140
If you don't tell me, I'll kill you!

13:25.478 --> 13:28.064
- [groans] T… Ten.
- [gunshot]

13:31.359 --> 13:32.276
[gasps]

13:34.529 --> 13:36.030
[sighs]

13:38.407 --> 13:39.992
Hey, that was the right thing to do.

13:41.494 --> 13:43.246
[Akira hyperventilating]

13:46.249 --> 13:48.251
The Transfloration Treatment room.

13:50.545 --> 13:51.837
[inaudible]

13:56.884 --> 13:57.843
Still have bullets?

13:57.927 --> 13:59.011
[Yorutake] I got 15.

13:59.095 --> 13:59.971
[Takami] Nine.

14:00.429 --> 14:01.430
Not a lot.

14:02.431 --> 14:04.350
Go inside the locker, young master.

14:04.934 --> 14:05.935
Stay low, okay?

14:06.018 --> 14:08.604
And we are going to pray
that you don't get hit by any bullets.

14:09.355 --> 14:10.314
[Akira] All right.

14:15.611 --> 14:18.364
Don't come out of there,
not till I say you can.

14:18.656 --> 14:19.657
[Akira] Kanaeno…

14:24.412 --> 14:25.663
Please don't die today.

14:28.291 --> 14:29.917
[in sing-song voice] Same goes for you.

14:40.261 --> 14:41.679
[Spiriflora buzzing]

14:53.566 --> 14:54.483
[rattling]

14:55.026 --> 14:56.235
[gunfire]

14:59.071 --> 15:00.406
[grunting]

15:01.532 --> 15:02.617
[grunts]

15:05.411 --> 15:06.412
[clangs]

15:08.331 --> 15:09.332
[groans]

15:16.631 --> 15:19.216
[grunts, groans]

15:21.177 --> 15:22.970
[panting, grunting]

15:26.432 --> 15:27.391
[gunshot]

15:30.394 --> 15:31.687
- [body thuds]
- [gun thudding]

15:37.944 --> 15:39.320
[screaming]

15:45.743 --> 15:47.411
Hmm. Now there's two left.

15:49.705 --> 15:53.209
Inspectors from the Archives are going
to be swarming this place any minute.

15:53.292 --> 15:54.335
You called them?

15:54.418 --> 15:56.295
I sent a threatening letter
to the Archives,

15:56.379 --> 15:58.631
along with a rather unreasonable demand.

15:58.714 --> 16:00.132
I said if they didn't comply,

16:00.216 --> 16:03.469
I'd show the public
all of Dr. Kudai's early research.

16:03.552 --> 16:07.223
[chuckles] I made it look like it came
from Transflora Medical Number 4.

16:07.890 --> 16:11.268
Now, make sure that
you capture Akira Yatsuka alive.

16:11.352 --> 16:15.564
I'm almost certain that he's involved
in our party member being kidnapped.

16:15.648 --> 16:19.610
I'll interrogate him and find out where
the information is being leaked from

16:19.694 --> 16:21.612
and what they're trying to do with it.

16:22.530 --> 16:24.115
[ominous music playing]

16:27.201 --> 16:28.202
[empty bullet chamber clicking]

16:28.786 --> 16:29.829
Huh?

16:29.912 --> 16:31.288
- [Takami grunts]
- That hurt.

16:32.415 --> 16:33.958
[both grunting]

16:39.296 --> 16:40.548
[Harubara groans]

16:40.631 --> 16:41.465
[Saeko grunting]

16:43.676 --> 16:46.262
[Tachibana] Now, now,
what are you trying to do?

16:46.345 --> 16:48.889
You really think
it's that smart to threaten us

16:48.973 --> 16:51.350
when you're just
a Transflora Medical employee?

16:51.892 --> 16:54.145
I told you,
I don't know anything about it.

16:54.228 --> 16:57.023
I never requested that
the Head Archivist be dismissed.

16:57.106 --> 16:58.149
I'm telling the truth.

16:58.232 --> 17:00.526
I also don't know anything
about the doctor's early research.

17:00.609 --> 17:01.610
Well, regardless of that,

17:01.694 --> 17:04.321
you still tried to view
secret documents about Dr. Kudai.

17:04.405 --> 17:06.824
Since you didn't have
the sufficient authorization,

17:06.907 --> 17:08.784
you tried to get
the Head Archivist removed

17:08.868 --> 17:11.579
so that it would be easier for you
to gain access. Is that right?

17:11.662 --> 17:13.873
[groans in pain]
What the hell are you talking about?

17:14.331 --> 17:15.666
You are so stubborn.

17:16.459 --> 17:18.544
[screaming in pain]

17:19.253 --> 17:20.755
[Saeko panting, grunting]

17:21.756 --> 17:22.965
[coughing]

17:23.758 --> 17:26.093
[Jin] <i>I can't tell her</i>
<i>about the fake document.</i>

17:26.177 --> 17:27.762
<i>It would ruin the whole plan.</i>

17:27.845 --> 17:31.182
<i>Even if I told her everything</i>
<i>and asked her for her help,</i>

17:31.265 --> 17:33.100
<i>if they found out about Toshiro's power,</i>

17:33.184 --> 17:35.019
<i>the Transfloration Board</i>
<i>would go after him.</i>

17:35.102 --> 17:36.353
<i>That wouldn't end well.</i>

17:36.437 --> 17:37.605
[sniffling]

17:39.815 --> 17:41.859
You're really hanging in there.

17:42.068 --> 17:44.153
Hey, you wanna trade secrets with me?

17:47.156 --> 17:49.408
I'll tell you the truth
about your colleague's death

17:49.492 --> 17:51.869
in exchange for what
you're hiding from me right now.

17:51.952 --> 17:53.120
[Jin grunting]

17:55.664 --> 17:57.750
[melancholy music playing]

17:58.584 --> 18:00.127
[Jin breathing shakily]

18:02.880 --> 18:05.508
I'm not interested
in what happened in the past.

18:09.261 --> 18:10.638
I'm betting on the present.

18:11.388 --> 18:14.141
Well, if that's true,
then you're no good at gambling, are you?

18:20.940 --> 18:22.483
[Saeko and Harubara grunting]

18:29.156 --> 18:30.199
[yells]

18:31.200 --> 18:32.284
[metallic clanging]

18:32.368 --> 18:33.661
[Saeko gasping, panting]

18:37.832 --> 18:39.750
- [Saeko grunts]
- Did your lungs collapse?

18:39.834 --> 18:42.711
That'll make it easier for me
to cut you in two.

18:45.464 --> 18:46.715
[grunting]

18:48.050 --> 18:49.969
Akira Yatsuka's in a locker, isn't he?

18:50.052 --> 18:51.262
[Saeko gasping]

18:56.433 --> 18:57.601
[melancholy music playing]

18:58.435 --> 19:00.479
BONE MARROW TRANSPLANT CONSENT FORM

19:04.066 --> 19:05.359
[inaudible]

19:06.068 --> 19:07.528
[melancholy music continues]

19:22.918 --> 19:26.338
[Saeko] <i>I'm done with</i>
<i>not being able to do anything.</i>

19:29.758 --> 19:31.635
<i>I don't want to lose anyone again.</i>

19:35.014 --> 19:36.765
Kanaeno, it's been a while.

19:39.393 --> 19:42.980
[Saeko] <i>I will protect you,</i>
<i>even if it costs me my life.</i>

19:43.063 --> 19:44.398
[melancholy music continues]

19:47.902 --> 19:49.069
[male voice 1] <i>Love.</i>

19:49.153 --> 19:50.404
[female voice 1] <i>It's love.</i>

19:50.487 --> 19:51.697
[female voice 2] <i>Love!</i>

19:54.575 --> 19:56.702
[female voice 3] <i>Self-sacrificing love.</i>

19:59.455 --> 20:01.415
[male voice 2]
<i>Love with a sense of purpose.</i>

20:03.500 --> 20:04.877
[child's voice] <i>Become a warrior.</i>

20:04.960 --> 20:07.546
<i>Devote yourself to something</i>
<i>greater than you.</i>

20:08.547 --> 20:10.674
[music uplifts]

20:18.140 --> 20:19.725
[Saeko grunting]

20:19.808 --> 20:22.269
Now say goodbye to your lower half.

20:23.312 --> 20:24.730
[Harubara straining]

20:26.232 --> 20:28.067
What the… It won't budge.

20:28.776 --> 20:30.110
Is there something in…

20:33.447 --> 20:36.116
[Saeko grunting, panting]

20:42.873 --> 20:45.251
[choking]

20:48.254 --> 20:50.130
[strained breathing]

20:52.341 --> 20:53.384
[laughs]

20:56.929 --> 20:58.347
[protestors clamoring]

20:59.098 --> 21:01.642
[grunts] Hey! Stop!

21:02.935 --> 21:05.104
[man 1] You won't get away with this!

21:05.187 --> 21:06.438
[man 2] We got your back!

21:06.522 --> 21:07.982
[man 3] Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

21:08.065 --> 21:09.441
[man 1] Get outta here!

21:10.276 --> 21:11.735
- [man 4] Get ready!
- [man 2] Here!

21:11.819 --> 21:13.946
[man 1] Through! Push through! Let's go!

21:15.406 --> 21:17.074
[Saeko breathing shakily]

21:23.247 --> 21:24.873
[baseball bat clangs]

21:28.043 --> 21:29.295
[panting]

21:30.546 --> 21:31.630
[Akira] Kanaeno.

21:32.214 --> 21:33.257
Kanaeno!

21:36.051 --> 21:38.304
Kanaeno! Hey! Stay with me!

21:38.762 --> 21:42.850
[Saeko] I didn't say
you could come out yet. [coughs]

21:44.143 --> 21:45.144
[Akira] Hey!

21:45.853 --> 21:47.021
[coughing, gasping]

21:47.104 --> 21:48.272
Kanaeno!

21:58.907 --> 22:01.035
Is that… When did…

22:01.994 --> 22:03.829
When did you undergo Transfloration?

22:03.912 --> 22:07.791
Why would you… There's no way… You can't…

22:08.584 --> 22:12.921
[Saeko] Listen,
the 20 hours aren't over yet.

22:15.007 --> 22:16.258
[Saeko breathing weakly]

22:18.385 --> 22:21.096
Get out of here, escape by yourself.

22:22.681 --> 22:23.974
Take the document.

22:24.433 --> 22:26.393
[Saeko coughs, strains]

22:31.231 --> 22:34.068
I'll just deal with this…

22:36.195 --> 22:37.196
on my own.

22:38.447 --> 22:41.116
[strained breathing]

22:47.372 --> 22:49.333
[indistinct chatter]

22:49.416 --> 22:52.044
[inspector] The inspection
of container JZ-3 is complete.

22:52.127 --> 22:53.545
And containers six and up?

22:53.629 --> 22:54.671
Still in storage.

22:54.755 --> 22:55.923
I'll go get them.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.723
Oh!

23:05.349 --> 23:07.226
[panting]

23:12.731 --> 23:14.650
[Akira continues panting]

23:17.528 --> 23:19.530
[closing theme music playing]
